cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MACE, please cite it as below."
title: "MACE: A Multicore Agentic Co-Design Engine"
abstract: >-
  An LLM-agent system that plans, builds and verifies multicore OpenPiton
  designs on the CHIA framework from a natural-language hardware objective,
  with parallel task execution, a Verilator verification gate and
  failure-driven replanning.
type: software
authors:
